    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 36-layer planar dielectric filter on fused silica substrate with air incidence at 0 degrees, unpolarized light. Stack topology is fixed as alternating Ta2O5 (Gao) and SiO2 (Gao) layers starting with Ta2O5 (Gao) (layer 1) and ending with SiO2 (Gao) (layer 36). Optimize individual layer thicknesses with bounds set to baseline value ±8 nm for each layer, where baseline values are: layer 1 Ta2O5 (Gao) 78 nm, layer 2 SiO2 (Gao) 94 nm, layer 3 Ta2O5 (Gao) 65 nm, layer 4 SiO2 (Gao) 116 nm, layer 5 Ta2O5 (Gao) 137 nm, layer 6 SiO2 (Gao) 104 nm, layer 7 Ta2O5 (Gao) 126 nm, layer 8 SiO2 (Gao) 94 nm, layer 9 Ta2O5 (Gao) 140 nm, layer 10 SiO2 (Gao) 100 nm, layer 11 Ta2O5 (Gao) 107 nm, layer 12 SiO2 (Gao) 105 nm, layer 13 Ta2O5 (Gao) 119 nm, layer 14 SiO2 (Gao) 100 nm, layer 15 Ta2O5 (Gao) 124 nm, layer 16 SiO2 (Gao) 104 nm, layer 17 Ta2O5 (Gao) 110 nm, layer 18 SiO2 (Gao) 102 nm, layer 19 Ta2O5 (Gao) 126 nm, layer 20 SiO2 (Gao) 101 nm, layer 21 Ta2O5 (Gao) 117 nm, layer 22 SiO2 (Gao) 107 nm, layer 23 Ta2O5 (Gao) 111 nm, layer 24 SiO2 (Gao) 105 nm, layer 25 Ta2O5 (Gao) 120 nm, layer 26 SiO2 (Gao) 105 nm, layer 27 Ta2O5 (Gao) 103 nm, layer 28 SiO2 (Gao) 103 nm, layer 29 Ta2O5 (Gao) 123 nm, layer 30 SiO2 (Gao) 101 nm, layer 31 Ta2O5 (Gao) 131 nm, layer 32 SiO2 (Gao) 100 nm, layer 33 Ta2O5 (Gao) 125 nm, layer 34 SiO2 (Gao) 97 nm, layer 35 Ta2O5 (Gao) 139 nm, layer 36 SiO2 (Gao) 99 nm. All thicknesses must remain within 20-350 nm absolute bounds. Use gradient-based thickness optimizer with local exploitation step schedule. Target objectives: maximize average transmittance in 420-700 nm band, minimize average transmittance in 355-365 nm band, minimize average transmittance in 1030-1080 nm band. Evaluate transmittance at 0 degree incidence, unpolarized.",
